VOID K passive analogue admittance mesh: two physical observation nodes
* Physical parts only; no behavioral source, no numerical noise generator.
* Output terminal PROBE_A and PROBE_B: calibrated high-impedance analog probes.
* Effective probes shown as 1Meg + 30p; revise values to actual instrument.
.SUBCKT VOID_MESH_V1 INPUT PROBE_A PROBE_B
R_M01 INPUT PROBE_A 10k
C_M01 INPUT PROBE_A 1n
R_M12 PROBE_A PROBE_B 22k
C_M12 PROBE_A PROBE_B 2.2n
R_MA PROBE_A 0 33k
C_MA PROBE_A 0 4.7n
R_MB PROBE_B 0 47k
C_MB PROBE_B 0 3.3n
R_PA PROBE_A 0 1meg
C_PA PROBE_A 0 30p
R_PB PROBE_B 0 1meg
C_PB PROBE_B 0 30p
.ENDS VOID_MESH_V1
